### Current user (replace the placeholder; never store a real token here)
GET http://localhost:8080/me
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Accept: application/json

###

### MCP tool discovery
POST http://localhost:8080/mcp
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "jsonrpc": "2.0",
  "id": "tools-1",
  "method": "tools/list"
}

###

### MCP daily log
POST http://localhost:8080/mcp
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "jsonrpc": "2.0",
  "id": "daily-1",
  "method": "tools/call",
  "params": {
    "name": "get_daily_log",
    "arguments": {}
  }
}
